  Nodes:
  - NodeID: Start
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "Finally! I\u2019ve been staring at my empty cash box waiting for this
      delivery to move. What took you so long?"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 1
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 1
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Look, I don't have a supercar, this is all I got!
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 2
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 2
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: "Haha! If you moved your legs as fast as Tuan Anh moves when he hears his
      dad\u2019s car, you\u2019d be done by now!"
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 3
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 3
    SpeakerName: Player
    Text: Tuan Anh has the luxury of speed. I only have the luxury of sweat.
    Choices: []
    DefaultNextNodeID: 4
    EventTrigger: {fileID: 0}
  - NodeID: 4
    SpeakerName: Lan (Street Food Vendor)
    Text: Whatever! Ok, so I will just give you the parcel, deliver it safe and sound
      for me, take care!
